Licence
  The skin art and palette are Xfire, Inc.'s own work (Info.xml's original
  author). Xfire is defunct; the Rekindle owner ruled on 2026-10-15 that
  Xfire's own assets may be used, and replaces them with the same command.
  Rekindle's MIT LICENSE does not cover this pack.

